Keep a shared roots as an empty list of text.
Place "cat" into roots.
Place "bat" into roots.
Place "rat" into roots.
Keep a shared word as empty text.
Keep a shared chosen as empty text.
Keep a shared bestlen as 0.
Keep a shared root as empty text.
Keep a shared rootlast as 0.
To settle with limit (a whole number).
The extent is rootlast plus 1.
If extent is less than limit, set chosen to root, set bestlen to extent.

To examine.
The wordlast is the last position of word.
If rootlast is more than wordlast, return.
The prefix is the slice of word from 0 to rootlast plus 1.
If prefix matches root, settle with bestlen.

To scan from spot (a whole number).
If spot is more than the last position of roots, return.
Set root to item spot of roots.
Set rootlast to the last position of root.
Examine.
Scan from spot plus 1.

The words is a list of "the", "cattle", "was", "rattled", "by", "the", and "battery".
The answers is an empty list of text.
For each entry in words.
Set word to entry.
Set chosen to entry.
Set bestlen to 1000.
Scan from 0.
The kept is a copy of chosen.
Place kept into answers.

The line is join answers with " ".
Show line.
